(2425367, 335348, 53964, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF is a wonderful tool, but not when it only leaves a sliver of your main subject in focus, and not even a critical sliver at that.  Instead our eye goes exploring the busy and distracting background. Also, centering the subject makes it very static.  Hope there''s something here that helps...</td>', 'Shallow DOF is a wonderful tool, but not when it only leaves a sliver of your main subject in focus, and not even a critical sliver at that.  Instead our eye goes exploring the busy and distracting background. Also, centering the subject makes it very static.  Hope there''s something here that helps...', '2006-05-17 13:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
