(2425523, 333385, 53964, '<td valign="top">I''m sure by now you realise there''s no lenscap, so I''ll comment on the photo you DID submit. I do like the colour and haze, but the tilted horizon is a major distraction, and easily corrected. Also, centering your subject gives a very static feel. Try cropping to the rule of thirds and see the difference. If you''re not sure about any of this, a search of the forums will bring up a wealth of information :)</td>', 'I''m sure by now you realise there''s no lenscap, so I''ll comment on the photo you DID submit. I do like the colour and haze, but the tilted horizon is a major distraction, and easily corrected. Also, centering your subject gives a very static feel. Try cropping to the rule of thirds and see the difference. If you''re not sure about any of this, a search of the forums will bring up a wealth of information :)', '2006-05-17 13:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
