(2426885, 332710, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not trying to be mean, just explaining the low vote: DNMC - no lens cap. <br/>I think that perhaps the challenge was misinterpreted as ''Landscape''? Had the challenge been landscape, this would have been my comment: While the colors are pretty, your horizon is slightly tilted (about a degree or so). The photo is too small - you will score much higher (even with a DNMC) if you use the full 640 pixels allowed.</td>', 'Not trying to be mean, just explaining the low vote: DNMC - no lens cap. I think that perhaps the challenge was misinterpreted as ''Landscape''? Had the challenge been landscape, this would have been my comment: While the colors are pretty, your horizon is slightly tilted (about a degree or so). The photo is too small - you will score much higher (even with a DNMC) if you use the full 640 pixels allowed.', '2006-05-17 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
