(2426896, 333385, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not trying to be mean, just explaining the low vote: DNMC - no lens cap. <br/>I think that perhaps the challenge was misinterpreted as ''Landscape''(?). Had the challenge been landscape, this would have been my comment: Your horizon is badly tilted - everything is running downhill to the left. Centering the boat and fisherman is not very interesting compositionally. The reflection is nice, and the colors are soothing, but unfortunately it is not enough to overcome the tilt and the composition.</td>', 'Not trying to be mean, just explaining the low vote: DNMC - no lens cap. I think that perhaps the challenge was misinterpreted as ''Landscape''(?). Had the challenge been landscape, this would have been my comment: Your horizon is badly tilted - everything is running downhill to the left. Centering the boat and fisherman is not very interesting compositionally. The reflection is nice, and the colors are soothing, but unfortunately it is not enough to overcome the tilt and the composition.', '2006-05-17 19:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
