(2428508, 333385, 41574, '<td valign="top">What the hell? Where are the lens caps? Is the guy tossing them from the boat? If so, I can''t do anything but "take your word for it." If he is doing so, you should have shown so better; if not, then this image just doesn''t belong in this challenge. It''s a nice shot (I rather like the tilt of the horizon [sincerely]), but I can''t give it a high score because of the distinct possiblity that it disregards the "lens-cap" theme.</td>', 'What the hell? Where are the lens caps? Is the guy tossing them from the boat? If so, I can''t do anything but "take your word for it." If he is doing so, you should have shown so better; if not, then this image just doesn''t belong in this challenge. It''s a nice shot (I rather like the tilt of the horizon [sincerely]), but I can''t give it a high score because of the distinct possiblity that it disregards the "lens-cap" theme.', '2006-05-18 02:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
