(2429705, 335421, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute. The depth of field gives the secret away. The lenscap is sharp, like the rocks, and the focus on the vehicle is soft. A smaller f/stop would have made this more realistic.</td>', 'Very cute. The depth of field gives the secret away. The lenscap is sharp, like the rocks, and the focus on the vehicle is soft. A smaller f/stop would have made this more realistic.', '2006-05-18 11:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429708, 335047, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, if you were at a standing a little lower it would make the lens cap more prominent.  Your lens cap is almost lost in the shot due to how small and location compared to the landscape.</td>', 'Nice idea, if you were at a standing a little lower it would make the lens cap more prominent.  Your lens cap is almost lost in the shot due to how small and location compared to the landscape.', '2006-05-18 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429713, 333838, 56828, '<td valign="top">wow...sharp photo. great clarity.  All around great shot.</td>', 'wow...sharp photo. great clarity.  All around great shot.', '2006-05-18 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429714, 334339, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast of textures - rusted metal versus smooth plastic. Your alignment is very close, though there''s a bit of a gap at the bottom of the lenscap. A very effective use of an idea that several other entries used.</td>', 'I really like the contrast of textures - rusted metal versus smooth plastic. Your alignment is very close, though there''s a bit of a gap at the bottom of the lenscap. A very effective use of an idea that several other entries used.', '2006-05-18 12:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429715, 335344, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photo.</td>', 'Nice sharp photo.', '2006-05-18 12:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429718, 335057, 12733, '<td valign="top">The most literal interpretation of the challenge: a lenscap and nothing but a lenscap with an attractive, eye-catching background. Nice.</td>', 'The most literal interpretation of the challenge: a lenscap and nothing but a lenscap with an attractive, eye-catching background. Nice.', '2006-05-18 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429728, 334827, 12733, '<td valign="top">Lenscap memorabilia! Nice composition and color background.</td>', 'Lenscap memorabilia! Nice composition and color background.', '2006-05-18 12:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429729, 335422, 30018, '<td valign="top">Cute idea...similiar to what I was thinking except I was going to use the lens caps to cover something else.</td>', 'Cute idea...similiar to what I was thinking except I was going to use the lens caps to cover something else.', '2006-05-18 12:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429735, 333396, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I agree with your choice of winner, but I like the photo and the interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure I agree with your choice of winner, but I like the photo and the interpretation of the challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429742, 332569, 12733, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think this would be much more effective if you''d chosen the lenscap with the writing to be sharp. The blurry text is - to me - an annoying distraction.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think this would be much more effective if you''d chosen the lenscap with the writing to be sharp. The blurry text is - to me - an annoying distraction.', '2006-05-18 12:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429758, 334436, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the color and detail. I think a square crop, eliminating the partial plant at the left, would make a stronger composition. The wet lenscap on a dry flower is incongruous - why not put some water droplets on the flower as well?</td>', 'I like the color and detail. I think a square crop, eliminating the partial plant at the left, would make a stronger composition. The wet lenscap on a dry flower is incongruous - why not put some water droplets on the flower as well?', '2006-05-18 12:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429778, 332640, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photo, but where''s the lenscap? The challenge asks you to make it part of the main subject.</td>', 'This is a very pretty photo, but where''s the lenscap? The challenge asks you to make it part of the main subject.', '2006-05-18 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429781, 335513, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the shot...almost a bond like reference.</td>', 'I like the shot...almost a bond like reference.', '2006-05-18 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429783, 333385, 56828, '<td valign="top">There is no lens cap in the photo and does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'There is no lens cap in the photo and does not meet the challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429785, 334974, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of closeup. The water droplets add interest to the lenscap.</td>', 'Nice use of closeup. The water droplets add interest to the lenscap.', '2006-05-18 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429791, 335260, 56828, '<td valign="top">The angle was awkward.  Felt the need to tilt my head to look at it.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'The angle was awkward.  Felt the need to tilt my head to look at it.  Nice idea though.', '2006-05-18 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429792, 334705, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute. It looks like you went to quite a bit of work to create this picture. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cute. It looks like you went to quite a bit of work to create this picture. Nice job.', '2006-05-18 12:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429793, 334509, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Is the lenscap really spinning or is this some kind of double exposure?</td>', 'Interesting effect. Is the lenscap really spinning or is this some kind of double exposure?', '2006-05-18 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429795, 335130, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great Idea.  Nice sharpness in the lens.  Great color also.</td>', 'Great Idea.  Nice sharpness in the lens.  Great color also.', '2006-05-18 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429801, 332710, 56828, '<td valign="top">There is no lens cap in the photo and does not meet the challenge</td>', 'There is no lens cap in the photo and does not meet the challenge', '2006-05-18 12:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429802, 334813, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute take on this challenge. I think a plainer background might keep the focus where it belongs - on the dummies and the lenscaps.</td>', 'Very cute take on this challenge. I think a plainer background might keep the focus where it belongs - on the dummies and the lenscaps.', '2006-05-18 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429808, 335354, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting and background. Clever approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting and background. Clever approach to the challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429809, 335441, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and textures. Nice approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and textures. Nice approach to the challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429818, 334627, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting commentary on the Sony takeover of Konica-Minolta. The folded label adds to the comment but detracts from the image quality. And the rough, scratchy looking foreground also detracts.</td>', 'Interesting commentary on the Sony takeover of Konica-Minolta. The folded label adds to the comment but detracts from the image quality. And the rough, scratchy looking foreground also detracts.', '2006-05-18 12:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429829, 335412, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t there a recent challenge about cliches and sayings? This would have been a great entry for that one - and a cute take on the lenscap challenge. I really like the colored sunlight shining through the feather. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Wasn''t there a recent challenge about cliches and sayings? This would have been a great entry for that one - and a cute take on the lenscap challenge. I really like the colored sunlight shining through the feather. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429833, 334309, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in textures. The sharp detail and lighting make the contrast stand out well.</td>', 'Nice contrast in textures. The sharp detail and lighting make the contrast stand out well.', '2006-05-18 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429838, 335286, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a great portrait. I like how you have used the light to illuminate the blue eye. Well done. (I hope you also have some without the lenscap - that would be a keeper!)</td>', 'Wow! What a great portrait. I like how you have used the light to illuminate the blue eye. Well done. (I hope you also have some without the lenscap - that would be a keeper!)', '2006-05-18 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429845, 334651, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition. Was it created just for this challenge, or was the lenscap added to an existing artwork? Cute take on the challenge.</td>', 'A very interesting composition. Was it created just for this challenge, or was the lenscap added to an existing artwork? Cute take on the challenge.', '2006-05-18 12:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429850, 334170, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute model, cute take on the challenge and a well done photo.</td>', 'Cute model, cute take on the challenge and a well done photo.', '2006-05-18 12:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429861, 333887, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice parody of a winning photo in an earlier challenge. Also, sharp rendition, good lighting.</td>', 'Nice parody of a winning photo in an earlier challenge. Also, sharp rendition, good lighting.', '2006-05-18 12:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429864, 335253, 45651, '<td valign="top">The focus looks soft and light flat. Great Idea.</td>', 'The focus looks soft and light flat. Great Idea.', '2006-05-18 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429891, 335051, 59093, '<td valign="top">this is wicked cool, to good to be true maybe?</td>', 'this is wicked cool, to good to be true maybe?', '2006-05-18 12:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429893, 333400, 59093, '<td valign="top">very cool pic! 10!</td>', 'very cool pic! 10!', '2006-05-18 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429918, 335029, 44995, '<td valign="top">maybe i''m not looking hard enought, but i don''t see a lenscap.</td>', 'maybe i''m not looking hard enought, but i don''t see a lenscap.', '2006-05-18 13:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430023, 332710, 30049, '<td valign="top">Huh?  Is this image in the correct challenge?</td>', 'Huh?  Is this image in the correct challenge?', '2006-05-18 13:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430034, 335421, 54172, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I''d preffer a deeper DOF.</td>', 'Nice shot. I''d preffer a deeper DOF.', '2006-05-18 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430076, 335562, 40005, '<td valign="top">great black and white, I like the contrast</td>', 'great black and white, I like the contrast', '2006-05-18 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430090, 334980, 40005, '<td valign="top">too noisy for me...</td>', 'too noisy for me...', '2006-05-18 13:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430103, 333400, 63884, '<td valign="top">koelieoelie</td>', 'koelieoelie', '2006-05-18 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430122, 332640, 40005, '<td valign="top">I agree it''s a superb landscape with nice colors ! but there is no lenscap !</td>', 'I agree it''s a superb landscape with nice colors ! but there is no lenscap !', '2006-05-18 14:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430132, 334158, 40005, '<td valign="top">nice texture and contrast !</td>', 'nice texture and contrast !', '2006-05-18 14:05:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2430133, 334544, 19507, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I think it could have been improved with a little better lighting and maybe a tweaking of the levels/contrast.</td>', 'I like the idea.  I think it could have been improved with a little better lighting and maybe a tweaking of the levels/contrast.', '2006-05-18 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430134, 335576, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and clearly you spent some time in making the "puddle" of "liquid" metal but the illusion is let down for me by the shadows between the bottom of the silver and the white surface. The holey surface (presumably where bubbles popped) is kind of odd too. BUT it''s a great idea and fun too.</td>', 'Clever idea and clearly you spent some time in making the "puddle" of "liquid" metal but the illusion is let down for me by the shadows between the bottom of the silver and the white surface. The holey surface (presumably where bubbles popped) is kind of odd too. BUT it''s a great idea and fun too.', '2006-05-18 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430137, 333140, 50674, '<td valign="top">wonderful idea and it came through too</td>', 'wonderful idea and it came through too', '2006-05-18 14:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430142, 332866, 50674, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, but I can''t find the lenscap.</td>', 'Stunning shot, but I can''t find the lenscap.', '2006-05-18 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430143, 335580, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fun! I like how the lenscap is an obvious focal point and yet doesn''t need to take up a huge amount of the image in area to be so. Composition feels a bit off - I think perhaps it would be stronger if there were more space infront of her than behind. Toning works well.</td>', 'Fun! I like how the lenscap is an obvious focal point and yet doesn''t need to take up a huge amount of the image in area to be so. Composition feels a bit off - I think perhaps it would be stronger if there were more space infront of her than behind. Toning works well.', '2006-05-18 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430146, 335354, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute - works surprisingly well and is definitely fun.</td>', 'Cute - works surprisingly well and is definitely fun.', '2006-05-18 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430148, 335382, 50674, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, but seems a bit on the dark side.</td>', 'Funny idea, but seems a bit on the dark side.', '2006-05-18 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430149, 334509, 63884, '<td valign="top">how?!</td>', 'how?!', '2006-05-18 14:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430152, 335371, 3087, '<td valign="top">LOL, fun! Love the low down perspective and the inclusion of just that much of the model''s head. Nice framing by the greenery and a fun and quirky idea.</td>', 'LOL, fun! Love the low down perspective and the inclusion of just that much of the model''s head. Nice framing by the greenery and a fun and quirky idea.', '2006-05-18 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430156, 332528, 50674, '<td valign="top">Now that is what I call stealing the scene :-)</td>', 'Now that is what I call stealing the scene :-)', '2006-05-18 14:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430162, 334193, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever and yes that''s just the kind of thing I''d do if lenscap were lying near biccies. Not that I ever dunk choccie biccies though!!! :o)</td>', 'Clever and yes that''s just the kind of thing I''d do if lenscap were lying near biccies. Not that I ever dunk choccie biccies though!!! :o)', '2006-05-18 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430168, 333630, 40005, '<td valign="top">It was my fisrt idea... ;)</td>', 'It was my fisrt idea... ;)', '2006-05-18 14:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430182, 335562, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and texture in the denim - the high contrast black and white really brings it out. Composition works. Course, I keep mine in my bra more often than my pocket - now THAT would have a been a fun picture! :o) Nice one!</td>', 'Nice detail and texture in the denim - the high contrast black and white really brings it out. Composition works. Course, I keep mine in my bra more often than my pocket - now THAT would have a been a fun picture! :o) Nice one!', '2006-05-18 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430184, 335344, 3087, '<td valign="top">ClOOOOOOOOOOOOOOse up! Like it!</td>', 'ClOOOOOOOOOOOOOOse up! Like it!', '2006-05-18 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430190, 335512, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like it - the motion blur adds interest to a simple but effective image.</td>', 'Like it - the motion blur adds interest to a simple but effective image.', '2006-05-18 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430194, 334315, 3087, '<td valign="top">Goodness, he actually does look cool doesn''t he? Like hte angle of the brickwork behind - makes it even more quirky. Nice close up composition, great lighting, nice detail in the smoke. All good!</td>', 'Goodness, he actually does look cool doesn''t he? Like hte angle of the brickwork behind - makes it even more quirky. Nice close up composition, great lighting, nice detail in the smoke. All good!', '2006-05-18 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430197, 334109, 50674, '<td valign="top">Good colours and I like your idea.</td>', 'Good colours and I like your idea.', '2006-05-18 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430200, 334478, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is weird but cool. Love the oddness, love the starkness, love the black and white and the toning, the composition is excellent. Really works.</td>', 'Wow, this is weird but cool. Love the oddness, love the starkness, love the black and white and the toning, the composition is excellent. Really works.', '2006-05-18 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430204, 334666, 19507, '<td valign="top">I think it needs some adjustment to the levels/contrast, but it''s a good, creative idea that makes for an interesting photo.</td>', 'I think it needs some adjustment to the levels/contrast, but it''s a good, creative idea that makes for an interesting photo.', '2006-05-18 14:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430207, 334476, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting, simple and beautifully executed.</td>', 'Interesting, simple and beautifully executed.', '2006-05-18 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430208, 335589, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good, creative idea.  Very well done.</td>', 'Good, creative idea.  Very well done.', '2006-05-18 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430213, 335591, 3087, '<td valign="top">Woooo... extreme shadow. Interesting angle and lighting.</td>', 'Woooo... extreme shadow. Interesting angle and lighting.', '2006-05-18 14:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430215, 335234, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Nice lighting, really brings out the details and oddness.</td>', 'Sweet! Nice lighting, really brings out the details and oddness.', '2006-05-18 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430226, 335051, 19507, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.</td>', 'Very creative idea.', '2006-05-18 14:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430227, 335344, 33725, '<td valign="top">Great macro work.</td>', 'Great macro work.', '2006-05-18 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430230, 335226, 33725, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-05-18 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430232, 335577, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very striking image. I hope you explain what you did!</td>', 'Very striking image. I hope you explain what you did!', '2006-05-18 14:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430235, 334340, 33725, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice, one of my favorites.', '2006-05-18 14:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430241, 334339, 33725, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the rusty wheel.</td>', 'I like the color of the rusty wheel.', '2006-05-18 14:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430246, 335292, 33725, '<td valign="top">Best in show (IMHO)</td>', 'Best in show (IMHO)', '2006-05-18 14:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430261, 335071, 45790, '<td valign="top">I feel it is too confusing because of the "distortion" caused by use of (what appears to be) a wide angle lens. I have trouble seeing the cap lanyard as going over the rim of the glass rather than through it!</td>', 'I feel it is too confusing because of the "distortion" caused by use of (what appears to be) a wide angle lens. I have trouble seeing the cap lanyard as going over the rim of the glass rather than through it!', '2006-05-18 14:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430274, 334091, 45790, '<td valign="top">Cute but sepia conversion doesn''t work for me because milk should be white and nothing realy gains from it.</td>', 'Cute but sepia conversion doesn''t work for me because milk should be white and nothing realy gains from it.', '2006-05-18 14:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430275, 334476, 45790, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space.', '2006-05-18 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430290, 334079, 45790, '<td valign="top">Image seems to be blurred.</td>', 'Image seems to be blurred.', '2006-05-18 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430296, 334478, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent a minute staring at this and don''t see a lens cap anywhere.</td>', 'I''ve spent a minute staring at this and don''t see a lens cap anywhere.', '2006-05-18 14:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430310, 333730, 45790, '<td valign="top">I think having the foreground in focus (which would put "Ni--n" out of focus) would look better because OOF forground is distracting. And I''m even speaking as a Nikon user!</td>', 'I think having the foreground in focus (which would put "Ni--n" out of focus) would look better because OOF forground is distracting. And I''m even speaking as a Nikon user!', '2006-05-18 14:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430314, 335414, 45790, '<td valign="top">Cleaver idea with good execution except harsh lighting gives annoying glare on "nose" and "mouth".</td>', 'Cleaver idea with good execution except harsh lighting gives annoying glare on "nose" and "mouth".', '2006-05-18 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430324, 332798, 45790, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and execution. Could be improved by eliminating eyeglass glare (removeing eyeglasses, or using less harsh lighting.)</td>', 'I like this idea and execution. Could be improved by eliminating eyeglass glare (removeing eyeglasses, or using less harsh lighting.)', '2006-05-18 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430335, 332710, 30893, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure you are aware, where''s the lenscap?, photo too small, etc..</td>', 'As I''m sure you are aware, where''s the lenscap?, photo too small, etc..', '2006-05-18 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430341, 335029, 45790, '<td valign="top">Where is the lens cap??</td>', 'Where is the lens cap??', '2006-05-18 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430344, 333385, 30893, '<td valign="top">Wow - are you going for the brown??? Horizon tilted - bad focus, lack of color and NO lenscap.....</td>', 'Wow - are you going for the brown??? Horizon tilted - bad focus, lack of color and NO lenscap.....', '2006-05-18 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430349, 333636, 45790, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit soft and noisy. Also uneven background is distracting.</td>', 'It''s a bit soft and noisy. Also uneven background is distracting.', '2006-05-18 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430356, 334865, 30893, '<td valign="top">Cute - I bet they are Happy Cows.</td>', 'Cute - I bet they are Happy Cows.', '2006-05-18 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430364, 334705, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I appreciate your modeling effort.</td>', 'Nice job. I appreciate your modeling effort.', '2006-05-18 14:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430373, 335172, 45790, '<td valign="top">Huh? Focus? Lenscap? Too small!</td>', 'Huh? Focus? Lenscap? Too small!', '2006-05-18 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430383, 334276, 30893, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - but you should pay closer attention to your background and lighting. Flash is too harsh - try a tripod and natural light.</td>', 'Cute idea - but you should pay closer attention to your background and lighting. Flash is too harsh - try a tripod and natural light.', '2006-05-18 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430385, 334544, 45790, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but tneeds to be brighter -- looks like he''s on the beach on a very cloudy day.</td>', 'Clever idea, but tneeds to be brighter -- looks like he''s on the beach on a very cloudy day.', '2006-05-18 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430389, 335393, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - 7</td>', 'Nice shot - 7', '2006-05-18 14:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
