(2434165, 335414, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great work while artist, sculptor, etc... You got a really wonderful light here. The subject don´t catch me in any ways. It´s not interesting to me but I apreciate you dedication and inspiration to build this, and the light you used to.</td>', 'Great work while artist, sculptor, etc... You got a really wonderful light here. The subject don´t catch me in any ways. It´s not interesting to me but I apreciate you dedication and inspiration to build this, and the light you used to.', '2006-05-19 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
