(2434216, 334109, 13759, '<td valign="top">I´ve never know this brand. It´s a very crispy picture. Good focus and almost good light. There are many reflections on the face, due to natural light. A good polarizer can help in this kind of situation.</td>', 'I´ve never know this brand. It´s a very crispy picture. Good focus and almost good light. There are many reflections on the face, due to natural light. A good polarizer can help in this kind of situation.', '2006-05-19 07:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
