(2436754, 332640, 56454, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a lens cap.  <br/>It is a nice picture of foliage and a waterfall.  Nice colors.  I would consider cropping a little to eliminate the floaters in the bottom right.  It would also make the waterfall bigger and maybe more dramatic.  IMO</td>', 'I don''t see a lens cap.  It is a nice picture of foliage and a waterfall.  Nice colors.  I would consider cropping a little to eliminate the floaters in the bottom right.  It would also make the waterfall bigger and maybe more dramatic.  IMO', '2006-05-19 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436784, 335130, 56454, '<td valign="top">Lens w/o cap?<br/>They must be prescription to have the difference in focus.  I''m not a fan of the blurry stump/rock (?) which is also very washed out.  You have a clever idea but I don''t think it was really pulled off.  I think that the OOF background should either be as sharp as within the glasses or completely blurred to be unrecognizable.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Lens w/o cap?They must be prescription to have the difference in focus.  I''m not a fan of the blurry stump/rock (?) which is also very washed out.  You have a clever idea but I don''t think it was really pulled off.  I think that the OOF background should either be as sharp as within the glasses or completely blurred to be unrecognizable.  Just my opinion.', '2006-05-19 16:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436801, 335029, 56454, '<td valign="top">No lens cap that I can see.<br/> <br/>It is a nice shot.  I love the color and like that the sun is still visible.  Curious as to how much is filter versus post-production versus reality.  I like the composition and your decision to have the legs go straight down into the water, making it hard to see where reality ends and reflection begins.</td>', 'No lens cap that I can see. It is a nice shot.  I love the color and like that the sun is still visible.  Curious as to how much is filter versus post-production versus reality.  I like the composition and your decision to have the legs go straight down into the water, making it hard to see where reality ends and reflection begins.', '2006-05-19 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436815, 333385, 56454, '<td valign="top">No lens cap that I can find.<br/> <br/>It looks like there was difficult lighting.  The darks are good but the rest seems washed out.  While I often like the use of big  "negative space", I think it works against this particular shot.  Zooming or cropping would give me a better impression of what the man is doing.</td>', 'No lens cap that I can find. It looks like there was difficult lighting.  The darks are good but the rest seems washed out.  While I often like the use of big  "negative space", I think it works against this particular shot.  Zooming or cropping would give me a better impression of what the man is doing.', '2006-05-19 16:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
