(2437082, 335421, 45790, '<td valign="top">The problem being the car is out of focus while the lens cap is in focus. Solution would be to photograph just the car and print it, then put the cap on the photo and reshoot. Not a literal interpretation, so it would pass the rules.</td>', 'The problem being the car is out of focus while the lens cap is in focus. Solution would be to photograph just the car and print it, then put the cap on the photo and reshoot. Not a literal interpretation, so it would pass the rules.', '2006-05-19 17:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
