(2437134, 335592, 56454, '<td valign="top">It is a good idea, as you can see by the other pirate shots.<br/>For a plain background, it is too much of the picture.  I think that chopping the top 1/3 off would be an improvement.  <br/>The lighting on the face is okay but the rest of it is flat.  You also get an unfortunate shadow from her chin.  Artificial lighting is a mystery to me and so I use almost entirely natural light (my unsolicited admission).<br/>IMO, the lens cap is too big for the model''s face.  Also, I may be missing the purpose, but I don''t know why she appears to be topless.</td>', 'It is a good idea, as you can see by the other pirate shots.For a plain background, it is too much of the picture.  I think that chopping the top 1/3 off would be an improvement.  The lighting on the face is okay but the rest of it is flat.  You also get an unfortunate shadow from her chin.  Artificial lighting is a mystery to me and so I use almost entirely natural light (my unsolicited admission).IMO, the lens cap is too big for the model''s face.  Also, I may be missing the purpose, but I don''t know why she appears to be topless.', '2006-05-19 17:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2437144, 335348, 56454, '<td valign="top">The image seems blurry except for the far edge of the lens cap.  DOF and a busy background take away from the shot, IMO.</td>', 'The image seems blurry except for the far edge of the lens cap.  DOF and a busy background take away from the shot, IMO.', '2006-05-19 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2437156, 335344, 56454, '<td valign="top">Strong, dramatic image.  Sharpness and extremely limited DOF.  I hope to find out what kind of focal length and aperature you used.  The contrast is blistering.  My favorite of the bunch.</td>', 'Strong, dramatic image.  Sharpness and extremely limited DOF.  I hope to find out what kind of focal length and aperature you used.  The contrast is blistering.  My favorite of the bunch.', '2006-05-19 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
