(2437177, 334158, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice dark, dramatic shot.  I like the inclusion of water.  I''m guessing that there was some rotation because I get a little dizzy if I look too closely for too long.</td>', 'Nice dark, dramatic shot.  I like the inclusion of water.  I''m guessing that there was some rotation because I get a little dizzy if I look too closely for too long.', '2006-05-19 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2437179, 335512, 56454, '<td valign="top">I want to rate you low just because you have a lens like that and I don''t.<br/> <br/>I like the composition, the lighting, DOF, and sense of "blowing in the wind".  I even like the layers of colors and light in the background, and typically that bugs me.  I like the warm light on the lens an lens cap and cool sky and mountain in the background.</td>', 'I want to rate you low just because you have a lens like that and I don''t. I like the composition, the lighting, DOF, and sense of "blowing in the wind".  I even like the layers of colors and light in the background, and typically that bugs me.  I like the warm light on the lens an lens cap and cool sky and mountain in the background.', '2006-05-19 17:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2437188, 334863, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors.  They work with the composition and the clouds to create some drama.<br/>The lens cap and "woody" arent'' as sharp as I would have hoped for.  Also, there is some noise in the background (particulary in the blue).<br/> <br/>Overall, a very nice shot though.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors.  They work with the composition and the clouds to create some drama.The lens cap and "woody" arent'' as sharp as I would have hoped for.  Also, there is some noise in the background (particulary in the blue). Overall, a very nice shot though.', '2006-05-19 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2437196, 334774, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice dark image.  Focus, contrast, and composition dominate the photo.  The width implies motion away from the lens.  Good choice to not have a thick border on the sides as well.</td>', 'Nice dark image.  Focus, contrast, and composition dominate the photo.  The width implies motion away from the lens.  Good choice to not have a thick border on the sides as well.', '2006-05-19 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
