(2438393, 333730, 54632, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail from end to end. Nice DOP. You''ve captured on of the sentiments of the industry. Looking at this you''d be inclined to think the photographer prefers Nikon over the out of focus Canon, although the Canon masks most of the Nikon symbol so you''re left wondering.</td>', 'Excellent detail from end to end. Nice DOP. You''ve captured on of the sentiments of the industry. Looking at this you''d be inclined to think the photographer prefers Nikon over the out of focus Canon, although the Canon masks most of the Nikon symbol so you''re left wondering.', '2006-05-19 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
