(2438554, 334980, 56454, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  I believe the lens cap is at the end of tube.  Unfortunately, the tube is a little off round,  I also wish I could see all of the lens cap (incluuding the tabs).  There is quite a bit of noise in the "sky". maybe from hiigh ISO or post-processing.</td>', 'Clever idea.  I believe the lens cap is at the end of tube.  Unfortunately, the tube is a little off round,  I also wish I could see all of the lens cap (incluuding the tabs).  There is quite a bit of noise in the "sky". maybe from hiigh ISO or post-processing.', '2006-05-20 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438577, 334340, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot - in my mind worth of an "ad" shot.  My only criticism would be the bit of green behind the petals.  I assume it''s a leaf, but since there is just the one it''s distracting, pulling attention away from the primary focus on the image.<br/> <br/>Again, very good shot.</td>', 'This is a very good shot - in my mind worth of an "ad" shot.  My only criticism would be the bit of green behind the petals.  I assume it''s a leaf, but since there is just the one it''s distracting, pulling attention away from the primary focus on the image. Again, very good shot.', '2006-05-20 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
