(2438607, 332641, 33400, '<td valign="top">OK this is disturbing.<br/>Still it''s a pretty good picture.  There are a few minor spots in the yellow that I think you could have cleaned up and a spot of fuzz on the camera strap. But the primary focus is good and the eye is not drawn anywhere besides the condom. So it works.<br/>It''s still disturbing (and I hesitate to admit that I didn''t realize they stretch that much...)</td>', 'OK this is disturbing.Still it''s a pretty good picture.  There are a few minor spots in the yellow that I think you could have cleaned up and a spot of fuzz on the camera strap. But the primary focus is good and the eye is not drawn anywhere besides the condom. So it works.It''s still disturbing (and I hesitate to admit that I didn''t realize they stretch that much...)', '2006-05-20 00:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
