(2439502, 335589, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I like the lens cap table and all the little furniture for the mouse. The paintbrush broom is really a good touch.</td>', 'Very cute, I like the lens cap table and all the little furniture for the mouse. The paintbrush broom is really a good touch.', '2006-05-20 05:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439503, 334826, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken and very well composed. This is one that manages to make a lens cap look like a piece or art.</td>', 'Very nicely taken and very well composed. This is one that manages to make a lens cap look like a piece or art.', '2006-05-20 05:59:02.000000', NULL, 1);
