(2439824, 334904, 34396, '<td valign="top">There were lots of "Cookies &amp; Milk" shots, but this one went the extra mile!  Great concept and layout.  There are a few shadows which I find distracting, but overall a GREAT idea!</td>', 'There were lots of "Cookies & Milk" shots, but this one went the extra mile!  Great concept and layout.  There are a few shadows which I find distracting, but overall a GREAT idea!', '2006-05-20 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439831, 335425, 34396, '<td valign="top">A good concept.  I like the photo and the creativity.  I think the subject is a bit close to the edge of the photo, I would have shifted everything to the left a little bit.  Overall, very creative!</td>', 'A good concept.  I like the photo and the creativity.  I think the subject is a bit close to the edge of the photo, I would have shifted everything to the left a little bit.  Overall, very creative!', '2006-05-20 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
