(2443732, 334315, 44052, '<td valign="top">There were a number of lens caps as glasses shots but this was by far the best executed.  The somewhat de-saturated look, slight sgrunge beardm and the smoke curl complete the cool look.  Cropping off the top of the cap quite so tightly detracts a little but still a top vote getter from me.</td>', 'There were a number of lens caps as glasses shots but this was by far the best executed.  The somewhat de-saturated look, slight sgrunge beardm and the smoke curl complete the cool look.  Cropping off the top of the cap quite so tightly detracts a little but still a top vote getter from me.', '2006-05-21 19:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
