(2444037, 334392, 54540, '<td valign="top">Clever figurine, but for me the part that "sold" the image was the background lighting.  On my short list, at the top!  Excellent entry, made me smile!</td>', 'Clever figurine, but for me the part that "sold" the image was the background lighting.  On my short list, at the top!  Excellent entry, made me smile!', '2006-05-21 20:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
