(2444046, 335388, 54540, '<td valign="top">Best pirate shot of the bunch!  Photographic face and I like the composition.  On my short list at the top.</td>', 'Best pirate shot of the bunch!  Photographic face and I like the composition.  On my short list at the top.', '2006-05-21 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444056, 334705, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a great take on a potentially boring challenge.  And you did it very nicely.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a great take on a potentially boring challenge.  And you did it very nicely.  Good job.', '2006-05-21 20:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444057, 335029, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is a really good photograph, I like it.  Only problem is I''m missing the lenscap connection.</td>', 'This is a really good photograph, I like it.  Only problem is I''m missing the lenscap connection.', '2006-05-21 20:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444058, 333838, 33400, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with great colors.  I wish the DOF were a little longer, but know that is dificult to do.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with great colors.  I wish the DOF were a little longer, but know that is dificult to do.', '2006-05-21 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444066, 334170, 54540, '<td valign="top">Good color combinations in this image.  The lenscaps could use some more flair perhaps, but again, I like the black, green background combined with the skin color and honest expression!</td>', 'Good color combinations in this image.  The lenscaps could use some more flair perhaps, but again, I like the black, green background combined with the skin color and honest expression!', '2006-05-21 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444071, 332710, 54540, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Two comments however.  Would prefer the image larger, meaning try to take advantage of the maximum size limit.  Also, I don''t see the lens cap connection in this image - but again - good shot!</td>', 'Good shot.  Two comments however.  Would prefer the image larger, meaning try to take advantage of the maximum size limit.  Also, I don''t see the lens cap connection in this image - but again - good shot!', '2006-05-21 20:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444083, 335130, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea for a photo!  Well done!<br/>However, I don''t see the lenscap connection, so I cannot give it higher marks.<br/>If this were an entry for advanced editing, the lower right area could benefit by being a bit darker - it''s a bit bright.<br/>Again - fantastic idea for a shot.  I like it!</td>', 'This is a really good idea for a photo!  Well done!However, I don''t see the lenscap connection, so I cannot give it higher marks.If this were an entry for advanced editing, the lower right area could benefit by being a bit darker - it''s a bit bright.Again - fantastic idea for a shot.  I like it!', '2006-05-21 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444087, 332542, 54540, '<td valign="top">I like this composition and color, nice shot!<br/>I don''t see the lenscap connection however, so cannot vote any higher.  Sorry about that!</td>', 'I like this composition and color, nice shot!I don''t see the lenscap connection however, so cannot vote any higher.  Sorry about that!', '2006-05-21 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444088, 332640, 54540, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph, but I don''t get the lenscap connection.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph, but I don''t get the lenscap connection.', '2006-05-21 20:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444096, 333385, 54540, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I do not see the association to the lenscap theme however.  (Sorry, but I cannot vote higher therefore.)<br/>My opinion on the image by itself:  I would consider straightening the image, and cropping some off the bottom.  Just my opinion.  I like the reflections in the water and the lone fisherman.  Good idea.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I do not see the association to the lenscap theme however.  (Sorry, but I cannot vote higher therefore.)My opinion on the image by itself:  I would consider straightening the image, and cropping some off the bottom.  Just my opinion.  I like the reflections in the water and the lone fisherman.  Good idea.', '2006-05-21 20:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444105, 334276, 15204, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  The lighting here is very harsh.  (I am guessing you used the on camera flash?)  Try putting your setup next to a window and using natural light next time.  I think you will get much better results.</td>', 'Cute idea.  The lighting here is very harsh.  (I am guessing you used the on camera flash?)  Try putting your setup next to a window and using natural light next time.  I think you will get much better results.', '2006-05-21 20:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444111, 332528, 54540, '<td valign="top">I see the border and title - clever idea, but I think this challenge was looking for additional pixels of different colors and/or shades!</td>', 'I see the border and title - clever idea, but I think this challenge was looking for additional pixels of different colors and/or shades!', '2006-05-21 21:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444113, 335379, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle and perspective.  I love the distortion.  I think the clock on the wall is kind of awkward and distracting.  8 from me.</td>', 'Very cool angle and perspective.  I love the distortion.  I think the clock on the wall is kind of awkward and distracting.  8 from me.', '2006-05-21 21:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2444117, 332866, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photograph, well done!  However, I don''t see the connection to the lenscap theme, otherwise, this would score really high with me for this challenge.<br/>Well done image!</td>', 'This is a fantastic photograph, well done!  However, I don''t see the connection to the lenscap theme, otherwise, this would score really high with me for this challenge.Well done image!', '2006-05-21 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
