(2447569, 335464, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is a different type of a flower;-) Clever idea, great colors;-)</td>', 'This is a different type of a flower;-) Clever idea, great colors;-)', '2006-05-22 20:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447572, 334478, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great setup.</td>', 'Great setup.', '2006-05-22 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447658, 335348, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but it has a few things holding it back.  the poor focus on the cap itself doesn''t help.  if the cap was more to the right, that would help the composition, as it''s very static at the moment.  curves might help the very bright window.  is that a cat back left?  basically, it needs more focus on the cap, both literally and figuratively.</td>', 'a nice idea, but it has a few things holding it back.  the poor focus on the cap itself doesn''t help.  if the cap was more to the right, that would help the composition, as it''s very static at the moment.  curves might help the very bright window.  is that a cat back left?  basically, it needs more focus on the cap, both literally and figuratively.', '2006-05-22 20:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447665, 334963, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but the colour balance and the tilted horizontal really don''t help.  if the milk was white, that would help a lot.  there are tutorials on both removing a colour cast and straightening horizontals.  the focus is good, and the composition is quite good.</td>', 'a nice idea, but the colour balance and the tilted horizontal really don''t help.  if the milk was white, that would help a lot.  there are tutorials on both removing a colour cast and straightening horizontals.  the focus is good, and the composition is quite good.', '2006-05-22 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447743, 334152, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think the lens cap was too close to your lens.  It came out way too blurry and lacking in detail.</td>', 'I think the lens cap was too close to your lens.  It came out way too blurry and lacking in detail.', '2006-05-22 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447749, 334786, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get the raised lip.  You could have looked like Billy Idol.  Very creative, though I don''t agree.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get the raised lip.  You could have looked like Billy Idol.  Very creative, though I don''t agree.', '2006-05-22 21:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
