(2450225, 335034, 59148, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Feel like the lighting could have been better. Would like to have seen it either with more color or done in BW. Nice stop action and Clarity</td>', 'Love the idea. Feel like the lighting could have been better. Would like to have seen it either with more color or done in BW. Nice stop action and Clarity', '2006-05-23 16:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
