(2450249, 334786, 59148, '<td valign="top">No comment comes to mind but keep it in the closet. This photo is unpleasant. Either its over exposed or the lack of color in the pgoto makes everything seem bleached out. Canon lense cap is out of focus and attention is drawn away from it to everything else. Back drop heavely wrinkled. Should have been titled differently too.</td>', 'No comment comes to mind but keep it in the closet. This photo is unpleasant. Either its over exposed or the lack of color in the pgoto makes everything seem bleached out. Canon lense cap is out of focus and attention is drawn away from it to everything else. Back drop heavely wrinkled. Should have been titled differently too.', '2006-05-23 16:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450252, 333444, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice CLarity, Good composition. This photo gives you a warm feeling all over. Also gives myslef the feeling of IT''S Mine! Nice</td>', 'Nice CLarity, Good composition. This photo gives you a warm feeling all over. Also gives myslef the feeling of IT''S Mine! Nice', '2006-05-23 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450256, 334980, 59148, '<td valign="top">Low quality. Too poor of a grain. Don''t know if photopgrapher was trying to make it look distorted or if this is just a side effect. Either way I do not find this to be good at all. Without the title I would not have been able to determine what the Photographer was intending.</td>', 'Low quality. Too poor of a grain. Don''t know if photopgrapher was trying to make it look distorted or if this is just a side effect. Either way I do not find this to be good at all. Without the title I would not have been able to determine what the Photographer was intending.', '2006-05-23 16:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
