(2451294, 334857, 17203, '<td valign="top">More like Made in Atlantis...? You could have created a nice still life with the same leaves on a slab of marble or wood. The water just adds clutter IMO.</td>', 'More like Made in Atlantis...? You could have created a nice still life with the same leaves on a slab of marble or wood. The water just adds clutter IMO.', '2006-05-24 00:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451306, 335576, 17203, '<td valign="top">Heh... now where have I seen this before? Looks like you were working with something too rigid to create a smooth transition. Something like Play Doh or molasses might have provided cleaner joints. Still, a clever take on the challenge.</td>', 'Heh... now where have I seen this before? Looks like you were working with something too rigid to create a smooth transition. Something like Play Doh or molasses might have provided cleaner joints. Still, a clever take on the challenge.', '2006-05-24 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451367, 334079, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great shot although borderline DNMC as the main subject isn''t the lens cap, but the camera itself. However, marvelous capture of a flash, for all those that gave this photo less than 5, they should try to do the same thing and keep the amount of detail in it.</td>', 'Great shot although borderline DNMC as the main subject isn''t the lens cap, but the camera itself. However, marvelous capture of a flash, for all those that gave this photo less than 5, they should try to do the same thing and keep the amount of detail in it.', '2006-05-24 00:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451371, 335006, 29269, '<td valign="top">Original and refreshing... deserving of a bump.<br/> <br/>Edit: another bump, to 9. Second best in the challenge, I hope that this would ribbon.</td>', 'Original and refreshing... deserving of a bump. Edit: another bump, to 9. Second best in the challenge, I hope that this would ribbon.', '2006-05-24 00:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451378, 335387, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the message didn''t come across as lenscaps being overprotected. It looked to me rather like the operator is overprotected. I guess satin gloves would have made for a better effect than the hygienic rubber gloves :-)</td>', 'Nice idea, but the message didn''t come across as lenscaps being overprotected. It looked to me rather like the operator is overprotected. I guess satin gloves would have made for a better effect than the hygienic rubber gloves :-)', '2006-05-24 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451384, 333983, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, final bump. (Still, those reflections are bothering me some. You could have placed some whiteboard or a canvas behind to eliminate those, unless you planned on having those reflections, in which case I just don''t like them. Still, worth a 8.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, final bump. (Still, those reflections are bothering me some. You could have placed some whiteboard or a canvas behind to eliminate those, unless you planned on having those reflections, in which case I just don''t like them. Still, worth a 8.', '2006-05-24 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
