(2451390, 334813, 29269, '<td valign="top">Not the best choice of a background, it seems like a rather careless setup. Or at least does not work for me. I''d preferred something more monolithic, such as the sand-and-dust-covered floor of a gladiator arena... Still a 7 for the idea that stands out in the challenge.</td>', 'Not the best choice of a background, it seems like a rather careless setup. Or at least does not work for me. I''d preferred something more monolithic, such as the sand-and-dust-covered floor of a gladiator arena... Still a 7 for the idea that stands out in the challenge.', '2006-05-24 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451395, 334478, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great tones, and the cap is well-integrated in the photo. Nicely done- one of my top picks. 9</td>', 'Great tones, and the cap is well-integrated in the photo. Nicely done- one of my top picks. 9', '2006-05-24 00:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451399, 333400, 29269, '<td valign="top">FYI I can recognize the camera blur :-)<br/>Also, a better title would have been: "Where did I put my camera!?"<br/>Next time, wipe the roof, as it would have been a cleaner shot. One final bump of the evening. 8.</td>', 'FYI I can recognize the camera blur :-)Also, a better title would have been: "Where did I put my camera!?"Next time, wipe the roof, as it would have been a cleaner shot. One final bump of the evening. 8.', '2006-05-24 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
