(2451401, 334994, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation of a lenscap. One of my favourite photos of this challenge, but I''m afraid that others won''t like the technical imperfections, such as overexposure and therefore lost detail in your whites. If it was any better, it would have scored higher just based on the idea and setup. This way I have to give it only a 7.</td>', 'Nice presentation of a lenscap. One of my favourite photos of this challenge, but I''m afraid that others won''t like the technical imperfections, such as overexposure and therefore lost detail in your whites. If it was any better, it would have scored higher just based on the idea and setup. This way I have to give it only a 7.', '2006-05-24 00:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451402, 335599, 55558, '<td valign="top">Noooooooo!!! Hang on!!!!!!</td>', 'Noooooooo!!! Hang on!!!!!!', '2006-05-24 00:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
