(2451990, 335589, 51386, '<td valign="top">WTF??? Hahahah, this one definitely takes the cake... or the lenscap? I actually like the lighting here, because it adds to the mousehole feeling of the shot. Most impressive, however is the creativity. I knew whoever was taking the blue on this challenge would be going outta the way to get it. Congrats on a more than well deserved blue!</td>', 'WTF??? Hahahah, this one definitely takes the cake... or the lenscap? I actually like the lighting here, because it adds to the mousehole feeling of the shot. Most impressive, however is the creativity. I knew whoever was taking the blue on this challenge would be going outta the way to get it. Congrats on a more than well deserved blue!', '2006-05-24 04:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2452000, 335051, 51386, '<td valign="top">This is really bizarre. I really thought it was somehow animated until taking a closer look. Congrats on the ribbon. I dont know how u got the reflections so perfect!Musta been a lotta work, but i really enjoy the whole eyeball effect u got going!</td>', 'This is really bizarre. I really thought it was somehow animated until taking a closer look. Congrats on the ribbon. I dont know how u got the reflections so perfect!Musta been a lotta work, but i really enjoy the whole eyeball effect u got going!', '2006-05-24 04:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
