(2452046, 335597, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/>Dude that so looks like a lemon! <br/> <br/><b>Technicals:</b> <br/>Well the foreground was exposed well but that background has a lot to be desired but you know that already. <br/> <br/><b>Subject/composition:</b> <br/>To sell the idea that this lens cap is indeed a ninja it would have been better if you had some of the lemon/pear remains on the lenscap. Might have made this more gory but hey it''s a ninja and it just sliced through that whole thing. :P Btw, I like how you composed this. Lots of balance and in your face action. <br/> <br/><b>Suggestions for Improvement:</b> <br/>Try and not make it a last minute thing?</td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  Dude that so looks like a lemon!  Technicals: Well the foreground was exposed well but that background has a lot to be desired but you know that already.  Subject/composition: To sell the idea that this lens cap is indeed a ninja it would have been better if you had some of the lemon/pear remains on the lenscap. Might have made this more gory but hey it''s a ninja and it just sliced through that whole thing. :P Btw, I like how you composed this. Lots of balance and in your face action.  Suggestions for Improvement: Try and not make it a last minute thing?', '2006-05-24 05:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2452058, 335441, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/><b>Technicals:</b> <br/>The lighting didn''t come out well but you did do a good job of minimizing the hot spots. As for the color it looks a bit dull to me. Maybe some photoshoping with the levels could have helped that a bit. <br/> <br/><b>Subject/composition:</b> <br/>Good idea for the subject. However, it wasn''t immediatley obvious to me due to the crop and the translucent board. I think this might have been one of those occassions where a view from the top would have been better. <br/> <br/><b>Suggestions for Improvement:</b> <br/>Hard to provide much here really. Honestly I think I would have just shot something else with more features rather than those translucent elements which seem like a nightmare to light. However, if you are going to shoot that try that above angle that I mentioned earlier. If anything it would make the idea easier to see in the image.</td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  Technicals: The lighting didn''t come out well but you did do a good job of minimizing the hot spots. As for the color it looks a bit dull to me. Maybe some photoshoping with the levels could have helped that a bit.  Subject/composition: Good idea for the subject. However, it wasn''t immediatley obvious to me due to the crop and the translucent board. I think this might have been one of those occassions where a view from the top would have been better.  Suggestions for Improvement: Hard to provide much here really. Honestly I think I would have just shot something else with more features rather than those translucent elements which seem like a nightmare to light. However, if you are going to shoot that try that above angle that I mentioned earlier. If anything it would make the idea easier to see in the image.', '2006-05-24 05:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2452060, 335589, 34938, '<td valign="top">This was a clear winner...thought this might ribbon and you did yet again!!! I love the story, it is so good to see how something like this is done. Thanks for taking the time to tell the story Shannon</td>', 'This was a clear winner...thought this might ribbon and you did yet again!!! I love the story, it is so good to see how something like this is done. Thanks for taking the time to tell the story Shannon', '2006-05-24 05:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
