(2452567, 334786, 36006, '<td valign="top">responding to your question in your authored thread.<br/> <br/>first you did get an above average score. second you received two favs.<br/> <br/>I did not participate, nore did I vote in this challenge.<br/> <br/>On the image itself.<br/> <br/>Humorous, comp ok, but maybe a bit tighter header. whites need tweeking. too washed out, should have more texture to be convincing. Blacks seem just ok. color flat, light ok, bg should be wrinkle free.ok shadows on face giving dimensional value. expression of model nice giving emotional value. overall the picture could be better. maybe bring the shutter speed faster, or open up the iris. <br/> <br/>Your work is usually outstanding. This example is not one of them.<br/> <br/>just my thoughts.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-24 09:28:46.</i></td>', 'responding to your question in your authored thread. first you did get an above average score. second you received two favs. I did not participate, nore did I vote in this challenge. On the image itself. Humorous, comp ok, but maybe a bit tighter header. whites need tweeking. too washed out, should have more texture to be convincing. Blacks seem just ok. color flat, light ok, bg should be wrinkle free.ok shadows on face giving dimensional value. expression of model nice giving emotional value. overall the picture could be better. maybe bring the shutter speed faster, or open up the iris.  Your work is usually outstanding. This example is not one of them. just my thoughts.', '2006-05-24 10:25:44.000000', '2006-05-24 10:28:46.000000', 0),
