(2452647, 334786, 22459, '<td valign="top">Cmon Doc, tell me that your not complaining about the score, this has got to be a total parody. <br/> <br/>I didnt vote on this one but I got a chuckle from the image so it would have scored it about a 6 or 7 I like images that make me laugh.<br/> <br/>The spread of scores is interesting. 9 tens, that must be from people who recognized you and 21 ones that must be from people that recognized you but dont like you.<br/> <br/>I would have liked to have seen the fist close together for us slow members so we could sound out the words easier. Absolutely love the wrinkled backdrop together with the mid-drift fashion gives the real trailer trash effect.<br/> <br/>Not sure if the white shirt with white backdrop work together but certainly gives a bright feel to the image maybe a splash of blood on the shirt or a piece of processed cheese dribbled on it would have broken up the white.<br/> <br/>What this image really needed was the bling it screamed out bling bling maybe some lenscap bling from the ears or lenscape bling from the chin just a little more lenscap bling  somewhere would have kept those DNMC  Nazis away.<br/> <br/>Great to see you letting your creative juices flow.<br/> <br/>PS Nearly forgot the bandana... now that is sooooo cool, needed a splash of red in it but.</td>', 'Cmon Doc, tell me that your not complaining about the score, this has got to be a total parody.  I didnt vote on this one but I got a chuckle from the image so it would have scored it about a 6 or 7 I like images that make me laugh. The spread of scores is interesting. 9 tens, that must be from people who recognized you and 21 ones that must be from people that recognized you but dont like you. I would have liked to have seen the fist close together for us slow members so we could sound out the words easier. Absolutely love the wrinkled backdrop together with the mid-drift fashion gives the real trailer trash effect. Not sure if the white shirt with white backdrop work together but certainly gives a bright feel to the image maybe a splash of blood on the shirt or a piece of processed cheese dribbled on it would have broken up the white. What this image really needed was the bling it screamed out bling bling maybe some lenscap bling from the ears or lenscape bling from the chin just a little more lenscap bling  somewhere would have kept those DNMC  Nazis away. Great to see you letting your creative juices flow. PS Nearly forgot the bandana... now that is sooooo cool, needed a splash of red in it but.', '2006-05-24 11:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
