(2454020, 335421, 30861, '<td valign="top">GREAT dedication to your craft, fellow Jeep-owner! Kudos from me. Regarding "tripod not going low enough", even if you HAD a Manfrotto with a reversible center column, you''d still have been laying in the gravel :-) It''s shots like this where tilt-screen LCD P&amp;S cams ROCK! I mis my 5700 sometimes when I try to get my old bones low...<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'GREAT dedication to your craft, fellow Jeep-owner! Kudos from me. Regarding "tripod not going low enough", even if you HAD a Manfrotto with a reversible center column, you''d still have been laying in the gravel :-) It''s shots like this where tilt-screen LCD P&S cams ROCK! I mis my 5700 sometimes when I try to get my old bones low... R.', '2006-05-24 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2454174, 335051, 50551, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, Mark, but it resulted in me getting beaten up by my wife! She found the image a little disturbing as it looked like a lot of eyes looking at her - which it does - and she took her angst out on me! She thought it was a great shot, though.<br/> <br/>Ouch - but we all have to suffer for our art - or yours in this case!<br/> <br/>Well deserved ribbon, too.</td>', 'Brilliant shot, Mark, but it resulted in me getting beaten up by my wife! She found the image a little disturbing as it looked like a lot of eyes looking at her - which it does - and she took her angst out on me! She thought it was a great shot, though. Ouch - but we all have to suffer for our art - or yours in this case! Well deserved ribbon, too.', '2006-05-24 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
