(2455801, 335459, 57886, '<td valign="top">Just love this picture. Congratulations on your forth place. I have been lookin through your pictures and I love the colors you seem to catch... Very bright and clear in most of your pictures. Great work you are doing :o)</td>', 'Just love this picture. Congratulations on your forth place. I have been lookin through your pictures and I love the colors you seem to catch... Very bright and clear in most of your pictures. Great work you are doing :o)', '2006-05-25 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2455942, 334392, 44878, '<td valign="top">Well done mate, I thought you might have finished a bit higher than 24th<br/>as I had you in my Top Six for what its worth.<br/>I finished way back in 60th with my Wrestling one.<br/>Better luck next time !</td>', 'Well done mate, I thought you might have finished a bit higher than 24thas I had you in my Top Six for what its worth.I finished way back in 60th with my Wrestling one.Better luck next time !', '2006-05-25 08:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456206, 335597, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Intelligent idea, very original for the challenge.<br/><b>Composition</b>: A bit strange, too centered and cropped too tight.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Good idea for the challenge.<br/><b>Technical</b>: Focus and use of the DOF is very good. Light on the lemon is too harsh, almost hurts the eyes.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Take off the center the logo of Canon, not so strong light on the lemmon.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Good idea. Keep shooting.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Intelligent idea, very original for the challenge.Composition: A bit strange, too centered and cropped too tight.Subject: Good idea for the challenge.Technical: Focus and use of the DOF is very good. Light on the lemon is too harsh, almost hurts the eyes.Improvement: Take off the center the logo of Canon, not so strong light on the lemmon.Summary: Good idea. Keep shooting. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456217, 335441, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Nice idea with a strange name on the lens cap (I''ve never listened of it).<br/><b>Composition</b>: Correct.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Maybe a bit difficult to understand. That game is not very popular in my place. But the idea is very clever.<br/><b>Technical</b>: It''s a bit dark overall, it doesn''t stand out for the colors. The exposition is a bit underexposed for my taste. Focus is very good.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Make a brighter image.<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Nice idea with a strange name on the lens cap (I''ve never listened of it).Composition: Correct.Subject: Maybe a bit difficult to understand. That game is not very popular in my place. But the idea is very clever.Technical: It''s a bit dark overall, it doesn''t stand out for the colors. The exposition is a bit underexposed for my taste. Focus is very good.Improvement: Make a brighter image. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456221, 335501, 24454, '<td valign="top">Darn it!  I hate it that this only scored 5.8 when it was one of my favorites.   As you know, I gave it a 10, and think it should have scored closer to where your commenters felt it ought to be  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Darn it!  I hate it that this only scored 5.8 when it was one of my favorites.   As you know, I gave it a 10, and think it should have scored closer to where your commenters felt it ought to be  :) ', '2006-05-25 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
