(2457187, 333603, 57775, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool.  Thanks for the votes &amp; comments - very exciting to end up in the top 10!  To answer the questions about the color of my lens cap, I didn''t use paint - I just saturated the pic in Photoshop.  There were yellow reflections on the cap from the petals, which turned a bright &amp; solid yellow once saturated.</td>', 'Wow, cool.  Thanks for the votes & comments - very exciting to end up in the top 10!  To answer the questions about the color of my lens cap, I didn''t use paint - I just saturated the pic in Photoshop.  There were yellow reflections on the cap from the petals, which turned a bright & solid yellow once saturated.', '2006-05-25 17:05:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457862, 334863, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>Great shot Deb - gave this one an 8. Funky background could have used a little less noise - but the shot overall has a great fantasy feel to it. Just looks cool. Well done and its always great to have a new pic in your top rated lineup.</td>', 'Trading Post -Great shot Deb - gave this one an 8. Funky background could have used a little less noise - but the shot overall has a great fantasy feel to it. Just looks cool. Well done and its always great to have a new pic in your top rated lineup.', '2006-05-25 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
