(2458136, 335441, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi there -<br/> <br/>I think this was a clever idea, especially considering the creative difficulties presented by the challenge. The composition itself is alright, but much too yellow. Somehow the colors look a bit dull and the edges of the game pieces look too soft. Not sure what to suggest for improvement on this one, perhaps more diffuse lighting?</td>', 'Hi there - I think this was a clever idea, especially considering the creative difficulties presented by the challenge. The composition itself is alright, but much too yellow. Somehow the colors look a bit dull and the edges of the game pieces look too soft. Not sure what to suggest for improvement on this one, perhaps more diffuse lighting?', '2006-05-25 22:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
