(2465185, 335597, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi there from Rebecca of CTP2.<br/> <br/>First impression is honestly: WTH? What does this have to do with ninjas? The top of the lemon is way blown out, as well as the upper edge of the lenscap, and the DOF is not working for the lenscap since parts of it are out of focus, and the parts that are in focus aren''t sharp enough. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi there from Rebecca of CTP2. First impression is honestly: WTH? What does this have to do with ninjas? The top of the lemon is way blown out, as well as the upper edge of the lenscap, and the DOF is not working for the lenscap since parts of it are out of focus, and the parts that are in focus aren''t sharp enough.  ', '2006-05-29 02:50:34.000000', NULL, 0),
