(2471261, 334789, 38496, '<td valign="top">Hi from CTP2:<br/> <br/>Very cute idea!  The focus and lighting is good on this.  The biggest improvement I could suggest would be to crop in tigher so that the two lenscaps fill the frame more, with just some of Big Ben the tower (big ben??  don''t know my London sights that well) in the bg.  The dark ''thing'' at the right is too distracting and doesn''t really add anything to the photo.<br/>Great job... this one was fun to look at and a great idea.</td>', 'Hi from CTP2: Very cute idea!  The focus and lighting is good on this.  The biggest improvement I could suggest would be to crop in tigher so that the two lenscaps fill the frame more, with just some of Big Ben the tower (big ben??  don''t know my London sights that well) in the bg.  The dark ''thing'' at the right is too distracting and doesn''t really add anything to the photo.Great job... this one was fun to look at and a great idea.', '2006-05-31 09:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2476340, 334863, 14414, '<td valign="top">Sorry to get to you a little late<br/> <br/>This is a really good woody shot, and a great humorous idea for the theme. The lighting is really impressive as it fits in perfectly with the background .<br/>Composition is strong, and fits the square crop well. <br/> <br/>There does seem to be a little soft bit at the bottom, on woody''s legs and the base of the lenscap, which is the only thing that bothers me<br/> <br/>Other than that, very good score/placing - well done :)</td>', 'Sorry to get to you a little late This is a really good woody shot, and a great humorous idea for the theme. The lighting is really impressive as it fits in perfectly with the background .Composition is strong, and fits the square crop well.  There does seem to be a little soft bit at the bottom, on woody''s legs and the base of the lenscap, which is the only thing that bothers me Other than that, very good score/placing - well done :)', '2006-06-01 15:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2480961, 335589, 57392, '<td valign="top">well deserved 1st place,top marks just for the idea,great set up.</td>', 'well deserved 1st place,top marks just for the idea,great set up.', '2006-06-03 09:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2491370, 335034, 39057, '<td valign="top">Good finish on your first entry.</td>', 'Good finish on your first entry.', '2006-06-06 19:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2492240, 334170, 21816, '<td valign="top">This is a nice little portrait. The main thing that I don''t like is the fact that her head is down which emphasises a slight double chin. If she had of been looking up a bit it would of worked a lot better. The other thing that would improve it would be just to adjust the contrast a little to make it pop out a bit. If you''re using Photoshop you could use an adjustment layer with levels just to help that a bit and still be within the basic rules. Well done.</td>', 'This is a nice little portrait. The main thing that I don''t like is the fact that her head is down which emphasises a slight double chin. If she had of been looking up a bit it would of worked a lot better. The other thing that would improve it would be just to adjust the contrast a little to make it pop out a bit. If you''re using Photoshop you could use an adjustment layer with levels just to help that a bit and still be within the basic rules. Well done.', '2006-06-07 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2495064, 334518, 37779, '<td valign="top">What a great top ten finish! Great idea and very well executed!</td>', 'What a great top ten finish! Great idea and very well executed!', '2006-06-07 15:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2504451, 334170, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea, that works well for the challenge..... You daughter is a beautiful model and looks great. I like the green background, as it suits the model, and is a good constart background color.....</td>', 'Very clever idea, that works well for the challenge..... You daughter is a beautiful model and looks great. I like the green background, as it suits the model, and is a good constart background color.....', '2006-06-10 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
